Subject: [PATCH 03/10] =?UTF-8?q?fix(db):=20endurecer=20RLS=20y=20permisos?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20seg=C3=BAn=20defectos=20QA=20P1=E2=80=93P4,=20P6,=20P7,=20P9?=
