diff --git a/docs/decisiones/ADR-001-unidades-de-stock.md b/docs/decisiones/ADR-001-unidades-de-stock.md
index e9dc9ec..e5bdfe6 100644
--- a/docs/decisiones/ADR-001-unidades-de-stock.md
